n**证据不足**。\n\n现有证据已确认为**应用层异常**而非基础设施故障（如 OOM 或节点问题）：\n1.  明确排除了内存溢出：Prometheus OOM 计数器 (E#6) 在较长观察窗口内始终为 0。\n2.  锁定了故障场景：日志 (E#3) 和链路 (E#4, E#5) 一致表明，应用在响应 `/work` 接口时发生内部崩溃（`runtime process exiting`）。\n\n但缺乏以下**决定性事实**来定义具体根因：\n- 缺少应用崩溃时的**堆栈跟踪 (Stack Trace)** 或具体的**错误消息详情**（日志中仅有 `runtime process exiting`）。\n- 缺少与特定**输入数据**或**资源状态**相关的关联分析，无法判断是否由特定请求参数引起。\n- 无法确认应用退出 (Exit Code 2) 是否与健康检查机制或其他依赖服务有关。\n\n因此，只能定性为“应用内部致命错误导致进程退出”，无法精确定位到具体的代码逻辑或依赖错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 37.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 83.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 83.2s (Evidence 71.1s, RCA 11.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 134.632, "metrics": {"run_id": "1efdd42f5b064827", "mttr": {"value": "2.2m", "seconds": 134.63669300079346, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weight